   "value": "<p><em>Disaster Storms — Cursed Technique Reversal</em></p><p>You can spend 4 CE to replace an attack on your turn with a burning ray from the miniature sun. Make a cursed energy attack against a creature within 120 ft. On a hit, you deal 6d6 fire damage. This increases to 8d6 at 6th level and 12d6 at 11th level. If this attack hits a creature within the radius, you add your CE modifier to the damage roll.</p>",
